WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.972
Pegawai Pegawai Perubatan, Tambahan.

2
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.668
Chief O&#x27;Brien dan saya berada di atas kapal pesiar T&#x27;Lani

3
00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.676
Membantu T&#x27;Lani dan Kelleruns

4
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.837
